---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Need help?" description="Free, confidential support lines in Italy for women experiencing violence or stalking, and for emergencies." path="/help/">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Need help?</h1>
    <p class="lede">If you or someone you know needs support, these services are free and available now.</p>
    <div class="example">
      <p><strong>1522: anti-violence and stalking helpline.</strong> Free, open 24 hours a day, every day, in several languages including English. Call <a href="tel:1522">1522</a>. You can also chat on the <a href="https://www.1522.eu" rel="noopener">1522 website</a>.</p>
      <p><strong>112: emergencies.</strong> For immediate danger, call <a href="tel:112">112</a> from anywhere in Italy.</p>
    </div>
    <p>If you are going through a very hard time, or you are worried about someone, please talk to a doctor or a person you trust. You do not have to face it alone.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
